  "notes": [
    "This data record is not an Arduino support declaration.",
    "All functions published for the F4P6 bond-out are captured. Digital remap routes were cross-checked against reference-manual Tables 7-8 through 7-14 and EVT definitions; OPA selectors were checked against Chapter 17 and EVT definitions. Individual ADC channel pads and hardware behavior are not yet fully cross-checked.",
    "I2C1_REMAP and USART1_REMAP use non-contiguous physical register bits [1,22] and [2,21], stored in selector-value LSB-to-MSB order.",
    "RM Section 7.3.2.1 incorrectly repeats the regular-trigger PD3/PC2 mapping in the ADC_ETRGINJ_RM bit description. Datasheet Table 2-2 and RM Table 7-13 agree on 0=PD1 and 1=PA2, which this record follows.",
    "TIM1_1_RM can route TIM1_CH1 internally to LSI and therefore has no package pin entry; representation of internal peripheral routes remains undecided."
  ]
